{
    "chapter_num": 12,
    "verses_count": 21,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Vision of Paradise"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "It is "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU necessary, though not profitable, to boast"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "doubtless not profitable for me to boast. I will come to visions and revelations of the Lord: "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "I know a man in Christ who fourteen years ago—whether in the body I do not know, or whether out of the body I do not know, God knows—such a one was caught up to the third heaven. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And I know such a man—whether in the body or out of the body I do not know, God knows— "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "how he was caught up into Paradise and heard inexpressible words, which it is not lawful for a man to utter. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Of such a one I will boast; yet of myself I will not boast, except in my infirmities. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For though I might desire to boast, I will not be a fool; for I will speak the truth. But I refrain, lest anyone should think of me above what he sees me "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "to be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " or hears from me."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Thorn in the Flesh"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And lest I should be exalted above measure by the abundance of the revelations, a thorn in the flesh was given to me, a messenger of Satan to "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "beat"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "buffet me, lest I be exalted above measure. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Concerning this thing I pleaded with the Lord three times that it might depart from me. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And He said to me, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“My grace is sufficient for you, for My strength is made perfect in weakness.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Therefore most gladly I will rather boast in my infirmities, that the power of Christ may rest upon me. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore I take pleasure in infirmities, in reproaches, in needs, in persecutions, in distresses, for Christ’s sake. For when I am weak, then I am strong."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Signs of an Apostle"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "I have become a fool "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits in boasting"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "in boasting; you have compelled me. For I ought to have been commended by you; for in nothing was I behind the most eminent apostles, though I am nothing. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Truly the signs of an apostle were accomplished among you with all perseverance, in signs and wonders and mighty deeds. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For what is it in which you were inferior to other churches, except that I myself was not burdensome to you? Forgive me this wrong!"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Love for the Church"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "for"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the third time I am ready to come to you. And I will not be burdensome to you; for I do not seek yours, but you. For the children ought not to lay up for the parents, but the parents for the children. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And I will very gladly spend and be spent for your souls; though the more abundantly I love you, the less I am loved."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But be that "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "as it may,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " I did not burden you. Nevertheless, being crafty, I caught you by cunning! "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Did I take advantage of you by any of those whom I sent to you? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "I urged Titus, and sent our brother with "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "him."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Did Titus take advantage of you? Did we not walk in the same spirit? Did "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "we"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " not "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "walk"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in the same steps?"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Again, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU You have been thinking for a long time that we"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "do you think that we excuse ourselves to you? We speak before God in Christ. But "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "we do"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " all things, beloved, for your edification. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For I fear lest, when I come, I shall not find you such as I wish, and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " I shall be found by you such as you do not wish; lest "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "there be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " contentions, jealousies, outbursts of wrath, selfish ambitions, backbitings, whisperings, conceits, tumults; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "lest, when I come again, my God will humble me among you, and I shall mourn for many who have sinned before and have not repented of the uncleanness, fornication, and lewdness which they have practiced."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}